{"1094720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clive 'N' Wrench", "steam_appid": 1094720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When mad scientist Dr. Daucus steals top-secret time travel blueprints, it’s up to Clive and his sidekick Wrench to jump through history and stop him before the timeline unravels completely. Your ride is a time-traveling refrigerator, and your mission is to jump, double-jump, roll, twirl, and glide through a wild ride of nostalgic 3D platforming adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 WORLDS. ALL OF HISTORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap from the icy cliffs of the Ice Age to the sandy ruins of Ancient Egypt. Explore 11 unique time-themed worlds filled with challenges, quirky characters, and hidden collectibles. Ancient Stones, lost pocket watches, and scattered keys are waiting for curious players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/6e000f159c7fa2781a272d54f3af13d6.poster.avif?t=1761610414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/6e000f159c7fa2781a272d54f3af13d6.webm?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/6e000f159c7fa2781a272d54f3af13d6.mp4?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OLD-SCHOOL MOVES WITH MODERN FLOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clive brings athletic parkour skills, and Wrench adds power and stretch. Master their full move set to scale tricky towers, dodge traps, and take on foes from across time. Learn the flow of movement and find hidden shortcuts as you improve your runs.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/4eca1e10d591494deb5a5bfab8506954.poster.avif?t=1761610414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/4eca1e10d591494deb5a5bfab8506954.webm?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/4eca1e10d591494deb5a5bfab8506954.mp4?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CELEBRATING A CLASSIC GENRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clive 'N' Wrench is a heartfelt revival of the 3D collect-a-thon platformers from the N64 and PS1 era. Created by a lifelong fan of the genre over more than a decade, it brings together era-hopping level design, fluid movement, and a playful sense of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/09066898d14703ce7daad9fb84f60d51.poster.avif?t=1761610414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/09066898d14703ce7daad9fb84f60d51.webm?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/09066898d14703ce7daad9fb84f60d51.mp4?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a full 3D platforming adventure across 11 time-hopping worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Pocket Watches, Keys, and Ancient Stones hidden throughout each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master agile parkour moves like wall jumps, flips, and the powerful Chimp Chopper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of eccentric heroes and villains pulled from across history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer challenging boss battles and enjoy a nostalgic retro atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When mad scientist Dr. Daucus steals top-secret time travel blueprints, it’s up to Clive and his sidekick Wrench to jump through history and stop him before the timeline unravels completely. Your ride is a time-traveling refrigerator, and your mission is to jump, double-jump, roll, twirl, and glide through a wild ride of nostalgic 3D platforming adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 WORLDS. ALL OF HISTORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap from the icy cliffs of the Ice Age to the sandy ruins of Ancient Egypt. Explore 11 unique time-themed worlds filled with challenges, quirky characters, and hidden collectibles. Ancient Stones, lost pocket watches, and scattered keys are waiting for curious players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/6e000f159c7fa2781a272d54f3af13d6.poster.avif?t=1761610414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/6e000f159c7fa2781a272d54f3af13d6.webm?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/6e000f159c7fa2781a272d54f3af13d6.mp4?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OLD-SCHOOL MOVES WITH MODERN FLOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clive brings athletic parkour skills, and Wrench adds power and stretch. Master their full move set to scale tricky towers, dodge traps, and take on foes from across time. Learn the flow of movement and find hidden shortcuts as you improve your runs.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/4eca1e10d591494deb5a5bfab8506954.poster.avif?t=1761610414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/4eca1e10d591494deb5a5bfab8506954.webm?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/4eca1e10d591494deb5a5bfab8506954.mp4?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CELEBRATING A CLASSIC GENRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clive 'N' Wrench is a heartfelt revival of the 3D collect-a-thon platformers from the N64 and PS1 era. Created by a lifelong fan of the genre over more than a decade, it brings together era-hopping level design, fluid movement, and a playful sense of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/09066898d14703ce7daad9fb84f60d51.poster.avif?t=1761610414\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/09066898d14703ce7daad9fb84f60d51.webm?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/extras/09066898d14703ce7daad9fb84f60d51.mp4?t=1761610414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a full 3D platforming adventure across 11 time-hopping worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Pocket Watches, Keys, and Ancient Stones hidden throughout each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master agile parkour moves like wall jumps, flips, and the powerful Chimp Chopper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of eccentric heroes and villains pulled from across history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer challenging boss battles and enjoy a nostalgic retro atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Hop, spin, and time-travel your way through 11 vibrant worlds in this lovingly crafted 3D platformer. Join Clive the rabbit and Wrench the monkey on his back as they chase an evil genius across history to save the future. And yes, it all unfolds from the chilly cockpit of a 1950s refrigerator.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/header.jpg?t=1761610414", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761610414", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761610414", "website": "https://numskullgames.com/game/clive-n-wrench/"